{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"It was crazy strong. Against <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE>, of all people, it was completely one-sided."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Who is that person...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I don't know. 
{PAUSE ""}
White Hannya, white robes―I've never seen an outfit like that, not even in the Arata settlement."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Could it mean something...?"</STYLE><PG>
"At least it means it knows the culture of the Arata settlement. 
{PAUSE ""}
Its weapons were a nata and a mace, too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Maybe there's still someone sane inside the settlement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah. It's wishful thinking, but right now the White Hannya is our hope. 
{PAUSE ""}
It must have burst in to save us."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then surely... it's helping </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Who knows... <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> wants to become a divine messenger of <STYLE ID="4">her own</STYLE> accord, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I don't know the White Hannya's true identity, but at least I can think of it as a force opposed to the Verde faith.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Still, as long as I don't know what the White Hannya is after, I can't count on anything it does.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The biggest problem is still how to save </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">On top of that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> wants to become a divine messenger of her own free will.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Saving someone who doesn't want to be saved isn't easy.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
