{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESON "500"}
"So then, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, why did they take you to that meeting hall?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm not really sure, but something like I'd become one of them too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Haah... What, were they gonna put a curse on you too, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>? It really is an evil cult..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Curses don't exist, but there probably is something similar to one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The fact is, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> ended up like that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Though what they were going to do to me, I can't say."</STYLE><PG>
"No, not necessarily. <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> handed me a syringe at the Niimura house."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, you saw </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I didn't tell you yet, did I? I went into the Niimura house first, looking for <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> two. 
{PAUSE ""}
And there was <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE>, walking around the Niimura house freely. 
{PAUSE ""}
So she offers me food, and the next thing I know she's handing me a syringe―"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Food and a syringe... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I see, that's important information. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, you didn't eat the food she offered you, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, it was way too suspicious... 
{PAUSE ""}
But <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE> was eating it like it was nothing."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That food probably really didn't have anything in it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s aim, I think, was to put you, </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, at ease and get you to take the injection. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No, of course part of it was probably concern for your health, </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So what, you're saying apart from being in deep with the Verde faith, <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE>'s basically no different?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I think so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The people who abducted me didn't try anything rough, either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">little kid</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was a bit scary, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The little kid she means must be </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It's true, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> marched </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> into the meeting hall at knifepoint.</STYLE><PG>
"But I don't get it... 
{PAUSE ""}
If they meant to make you one of them, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, they must've been planning to inject <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> too. 
{PAUSE ""}
So why haven't they injected you until now...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm... maybe the injection isn't the only way to become one of them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Look, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> ended up like that without any injection."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Either way, right now even </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> can't get to the truth.</STYLE><PG>
"Okay, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, here's what we'll do. 
{PAUSE ""}
