<STYLE ID="2">At that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> nods and goes on explaining the situation into the phone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I see. If the landslide means they can't get here, then nobody's even found the driver's murder yet.</STYLE><PG>
